      "id": "e41ae2c4-d58d-4e34-878c-2447eb237867",
      "name": "Custom Field",
      "description": {
        "content": "A **Custom Field** holds your account's user-defined values on a **Contract** (the fields themselves are configured in Alasco). It is read-only here and retrieved per contract (`GET /contracts/{contract_id}/custom_fields/`).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
